#. +> trunk stable
#: ksieveui/autocreatescripts/sieveactions/sieveactionsetvariable.cpp:182
msgid "The \"set\" action stores the specified value in the variable identified by name."
msgstr "De Akschoon \"set\" leggt den angeven Weert binnen de nöömte Variabel af."

